SEEKING OR TEETHING PRODUCTS

00:09:10.516 --> 00:09:12.084
THAT CONTAIN ANY FORM OF

00:09:12.151 --> 00:09:14.387
BISPHENOL, ALSO KNOWN AS AT A

00:09:14.453 --> 00:09:17.223
DETECTABLE LEVEL OF 0.1 PARTS

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.226
PER BILLION BISPHENOLS, COMMONLY

00:09:20.293 --> 00:09:23.062
REFERRED TO AS BPA OR PSE, IS A

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:24.196
CHEMICAL COMPOUND THAT IS USED

00:09:24.263 --> 00:09:26.632
IN A VARIETY OF INDUSTRIAL AND

00:09:26.699 --> 00:09:27.600
CONSUMER PRODUCTS, RANGING FROM

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:30.937
AUTOMOBILE PARTS TO FOOD

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:33.406
CONTAINERS. BPA IS CONSIDERED AN

00:09:33.472 --> 00:09:34.440
ENDOCRINE DISRUPTOR, WHICH MEANS

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:37.576
IT CAN INTERFERE WITH THE

00:09:37.643 --> 00:09:39.312
HORMONE SYSTEM IN THE BODY AND

00:09:39.378 --> 00:09:42.214
HAS ADVERSE HEALTH EFFECTS IN

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:45.017
CHILDREN AND ADULTS. ALTHOUGH

00:09:45.084 --> 00:09:45.851
MANUFACTURERS HAVE ELIMINATED

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.586
BPA FROM BABY BOTTLES AND SIPPY

00:09:47.653 --> 00:09:50.990
CUP PRODUCTS, THEY HAVE SHIFTED

00:09:51.057 --> 00:09:52.058
TO USE ALTERNATIVE CHEMICALS TO

00:09:52.124 --> 00:09:53.960
REPLACE IT, SUCH AS EPS AND

00:09:54.026 --> 00:09:58.130
BPFS, WHICH HAVE BEEN FOUND TO

00:09:58.197 --> 00:09:59.966
BE EVEN MORE HARMFUL THAN BPAS.

00:10:00.032 --> 00:10:01.400
IT IS ESSENTIAL THAT WHEN TOXIC

00:10:01.467 --> 00:10:02.468
OR POTENTIALLY HARMFUL CHEMICALS

00:10:02.535 --> 00:10:05.738
ARE PHASED OUT OF PRODUCTS, THEY

00:10:05.805 --> 00:10:07.139
ARE NOT SIMPLY REPLACED BY

00:10:07.206 --> 00:10:08.140
ANOTHER HARMFUL TYPE OF

00:10:08.207 --> 00:10:09.508
CHEMICALS. SB 1266 STRENGTHENS

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:13.245
THE COMMITMENT TO PROTECT

00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:14.246
CHILDREN FROM HARMFUL CHEMICALS

00:10:14.313 --> 00:10:17.316
AND AUTHORIZES HT, SC TO

00:10:17.383 --> 00:10:18.184
ESTABLISH STANDARDS,

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.919
PRIORITIZING THE HEALTH AND

00:10:19.986 --> 00:10:21.187
WELLNESS OF OUR CHILDREN. I HAVE

00:10:21.253 --> 00:10:23.556
WITH ME TODAY IN SUPPORT KAYLA

00:10:23.622 --> 00:10:24.657
ROBINSON ON BEHALF OF THE BCP

00:10:24.724 --> 00:10:27.093
AND RYAN SPENCER ON BEHALF OF

00:10:27.159 --> 00:10:30.696
ACOG. ARE YOU READY? PLEASE

00:10:30.763 --> 00:10:33.532
