KAYLA ROBINSON, ON BEHALF OF

00:10:35.668 --> 00:10:36.268
BREAST CANCER PREVENTION

00:10:36.335 --> 00:10:37.336
PARTNERS, BCP IS A SCIENCE BASED

00:10:37.403 --> 00:10:40.373
ORGANIZATION WORKING TO PREVENT

00:10:40.439 --> 00:10:41.440
BREAST CANCER BY REDUCING OUR

00:10:41.507 --> 00:10:43.175
EXPOSURE TO CHEMICALS LINKED TO

00:10:43.242 --> 00:10:44.944
THE DISEASE. BISPHENOL A, OR

00:10:45.011 --> 00:10:46.145
BPA, HAS LONG BEEN A CHEMICAL

00:10:46.212 --> 00:10:48.547
THAT BCP IS DEEPLY CONCERNED

00:10:48.614 --> 00:10:49.615
ABOUT, GIVEN ITS ABILITY TO

00:10:49.682 --> 00:10:51.517
DISRUPT OUR HORMONES, AND IT'S

00:10:51.584 --> 00:10:52.585
LINKED TO BREAST CANCER AND

00:10:52.651 --> 00:10:54.186
NUMEROUS OTHER HEALTH HARMS. AS

00:10:54.253 --> 00:10:55.287
THE SENATOR MENTIONED, BCP

00:10:55.354 --> 00:10:58.591
WORKED WITH ITS ALLIES TO REMOVE

00:10:58.657 --> 00:11:00.426
BPA FROM BABY BOTTLES AND SIPPY

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:01.794
