UNFORTUNATELY, ALL TOO OFTEN,

00:11:05.498 --> 00:11:07.199
BPA WAS REPLACED WITH AN

00:11:07.266 --> 00:11:08.200
ALPHABET SOUP OF BISPHENOL

00:11:08.267 --> 00:11:11.604
SUBSTITUTES BPF, BPF AND SO ON.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.106
WHILE THESE SUBSTITUTES ARE

00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:15.274
OFTEN LESS WELL STUDIED, THE

00:11:15.341 --> 00:11:16.909
MORE WE LEARN, THE BETTER WE

00:11:16.976 --> 00:11:18.010
UNDERSTAND THAT THE ENTIRE CLASS

00:11:18.077 --> 00:11:19.111
HAS IMPLICATIONS FOR OUR HEALTH,

00:11:19.178 --> 00:11:20.279
INCLUDING INCREASED RISK OF

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:21.280
ASTHMA AND HYPERACTIVITY IN

00:11:21.347 --> 00:11:22.214
CHILDREN AND CARDIOVASCULAR

00:11:22.281 --> 00:11:24.450
DISEASE, FERTILITY PROBLEMS,

00:11:24.517 --> 00:11:25.317
OBESITY, DIABETES, AND INCREASED

00:11:25.384 --> 00:11:28.154
RISK OF BREAST CANCER AND OTHER

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.456
CANCERS AND ADULTS. EARLY LIFE

00:11:30.523 --> 00:11:31.357
EXPOSURES ARE PARTICULARLY

00:11:31.424 --> 00:11:31.857
CONCERNING BECAUSE THIS

00:11:31.924 --> 00:11:34.326
DEVELOPMENTAL PERIOD IS WHEN

00:11:34.393 --> 00:11:35.428
THESE CHEMICALS HAVE THEIR

00:11:35.494 --> 00:11:38.964
