00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:40.032
IMPACTS, INCREASING OUR RISK OF

00:11:40.099 --> 00:11:41.200
DISEASE, OFTEN DECADES LATER.

00:11:41.267 --> 00:11:43.436
THIS EARLY LIFE IMPACT IS WHY SB

00:11:43.502 --> 00:11:44.603
1266 BANNING THE FULL CLASS OF

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.539
BISPHENOLS IN CHILDREN'S SUCKING

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:47.573
, TEETHING AND FEEDING PRODUCTS

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.707
